Exactly. The kiwi’s mistake wasn’t the leap. It was designing the experience without designing continuity.

We add the Golden Web beneath the mountain.

input / summit
→ committed descent
→ sideways forest
→ reconstructed experience
→ output
→ Golden Web
→ captured deltas
